    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d55">

                <pb facs="0294" n="36" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg36"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1812</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-25T16:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 25, 1915, 4 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 4.20 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>296. Austrian and German Ambassadors both to Quirinal and Vatican left Italy last
                    night. Understanding exists between Italy and Germany that private property will
                    be respected, also patent rights, sole exception being necessity of state.
                    Civilians innocent of hostile acts will not be interned.</p>
                <p>No steps yet regarding Turkey.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
